{"id":"86860ecaa6585b53","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-partial-program-completion.md","title":"df partial program completion","display":"df partial program completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-partial-program-completion","aliases":["72-df-partial-program-completion"],"display":"df partial program completion","depends_on":["[[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]","[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","[[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition6.1.1, print672–673/PDF684–685","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","proof_status":"definition-well-defined; signed positivity checked by structural recursion","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-partial-program-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-partial-program-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df partial program completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d49b9fae2b96976\" href=\"?note=2d49b9fae2b96976\" title=\"72-df-clark-equational-theory\">72-df-clark-equational-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c472b2ba86057172\" href=\"?note=c472b2ba86057172\" title=\"72-df-signed-predicate-translation\">72-df-signed-predicate-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition6.1.1, print672–673/PDF684–685"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined; signed positivity checked by structural recursion"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P\">\\(D_R^P\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\pm,R^+,R^-\">\\(\\Sigma^\\pm,R^+,R^-\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+,A^-\">\\(A^+,A^-\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c472b2ba86057172\" href=\"?note=c472b2ba86057172\" title=\"72-df-signed-predicate-translation\">72-df-signed-predicate-translation</a>。目标使用 core 的经典公式构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to,\\land,\\lor,\\forall,\\exists\">\\(\\to,\\land,\\lor,\\forall,\\exists\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^-\">\\(R^-\\)</span> 是独立的正关系符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CET}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{CET}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2d49b9fae2b96976\" href=\"?note=2d49b9fae2b96976\" title=\"72-df-clark-equational-theory\">72-df-clark-equational-theory</a> 的纯等式理论，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\pm\">\\(\\Sigma^\\pm\\)</span> 中视为相同的公式集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 取互异变量元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_R,\\vec y_R\">\\(\\vec x_R,\\vec y_R\\)</span>，长度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(R)\">\\(a_R(R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P\">\\(D_R^P\\)</span> 的局部绑定变量先改名避免捕获。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)\">\\(\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)\\)</span> 是下式引入的理论，所有公理都是全称闭合句子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cong}_\\Sigma^\\pm&amp;:=\\left\\{\\forall\\vec x_R\\forall\\vec y_R\\left[\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;a_R(R)}x_{R,i}\\doteq y_{R,i}\\land R^\\varepsilon(\\vec x_R)\\right)\\to R^\\varepsilon(\\vec y_R)\\right]:R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;:=\\{\\forall\\vec x_R\\left[(D_R^P(\\vec x_R))^\\varepsilon\\to R^\\varepsilon(\\vec x_R)\\right]:R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;:=\\mathsf{CET}_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathsf{Cong}_\\Sigma^\\pm\\cup\\mathsf{Cl}_\\Sigma(P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cong}_\\Sigma^\\pm&amp;:=\\left\\{\\forall\\vec x_R\\forall\\vec y_R\\left[\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;a_R(R)}x_{R,i}\\doteq y_{R,i}\\land R^\\varepsilon(\\vec x_R)\\right)\\to R^\\varepsilon(\\vec y_R)\\right]:R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;:=\\{\\forall\\vec x_R\\left[(D_R^P(\\vec x_R))^\\varepsilon\\to R^\\varepsilon(\\vec x_R)\\right]:R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;:=\\mathsf{CET}_\\Sigma\\cup\\mathsf{Cong}_\\Sigma^\\pm\\cup\\mathsf{Cl}_\\Sigma(P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PDF684 页图核对了 Definition 6.1.1：关系合同公理同时覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^+\">\\(R^+\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^-\">\\(R^-\\)</span>，两个闭包公理的前件分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D_R^P)^+\">\\((D_R^P)^+\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D_R^P)^-\">\\((D_R^P)^-\\)</span>。本地记号 pcomp 对应原书 partial completion。负坐标的定义式并不是经典的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(D_R^P)^+\">\\(\\neg(D_R^P)^+\\)</span>；它由 signed translation 独立给出。</p>\n<p>这只要求正负关系在相应正归纳算子下闭合，没有加入总性、互斥或最小性。合同公理在身份等号的普通结构中自动成立，但它仍是书中理论的显式组成部分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 子句时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P=\\bot\">\\(D_R^P=\\bot\\)</span>，两个闭包前件分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，所以负关系全域成立而正关系不受该闭包公理强迫。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-clark-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-signed-predicate-translation","status":"resolved","id":"c472b2ba86057172","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$D_R^P$ 采用 [[72-df-program-definition-form]]；$\\Sigma^\\pm,R^+,R^-$ 与 $A^+,A^-$ 采用 [[72-df-signed-predicate-translation]]。目标使用 core 的经典公式构造子 $\\to,\\land,\\lor,\\forall,\\exists$；$R^-$ 是独立的正关系符号。","embed":false},{"target"